# The e2e suite's own latest summary, read by tools/grade-claims.mjs to count skips. A local receipt,
# not source: written by the run, so it must never dirty the worktree.
.grade-last-e2e.txt

# The verification tooling re-renders these four screenshots on every run. They stay tracked (and keep
# serving from the last committed version), but a check that regenerates its own evidence must not dirty
# the worktree it is about to certify — that is what broke the deploy check three rounds running.
docs/boot-build.png
docs/shots/launch-1440.png
docs/shots/launch-375.png
docs/shots/launch-768.png

# Source photographs for the film's figures: staged only while tools/make-film.mjs runs, never shipped. The
# sprite carries the *plates*; the photographs themselves stay out of the repository.
public/film-src

# Generated plates, framed references and comparison sheets — outputs, not source.
print-desk-out

